<title>UK: UK panel clears Northern Electric share buys.</title>
<headline>UK panel clears Northern Electric share buys.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's takeover panel said in a statement that it cleared the purchase of a 2.32 percent stake in hostile bid target Northern Electric Plc by brokers BZW and Schroders, who are advising Northern, which is fighting an offer by CE Electric Plc, a unit of CalEnergy Co Inc of the U.S.</p>
</text>
